  "description": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"42\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"42\">Powerplus POWC2030 Cirkelzaag | €49,99</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"378\">De <strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"80\">Powerplus POWC2030 cirkelzaag</strong> is een krachtige en gebruiksvriendelijke zaagmachine, geschikt voor het nauwkeurig zagen van hout en plaatmateriaal. Dankzij het compacte ontwerp en de betrouwbare motor is deze cirkelzaag ideaal voor zowel kluswerk in huis als in de werkplaats. Het toestel is volledig getest en direct inzetbaar.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"399\"><strong data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"397\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"638\">\r\n<li data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"419\">\r\n<p data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"419\">Merk: Powerplus</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"439\">\r\n<p data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"439\">Model: POWC2030</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"460\">\r\n<p data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"460\">Type: Cirkelzaag</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"485\">\r\n<p data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"485\">Vermogen: ca. 1200 W</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"508\">\r\n<p data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"508\">Zaagblad: Ø 185 mm</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"545\">\r\n<p data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"545\">Max. zaagdiepte: ca. 65 mm (90°)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"574\">\r\n<p data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"574\">Verstelbare zaaghoek: Ja</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"613\">Toepassing: Hout en plaatmateriaal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"638\">\r\n<p data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"638\">Aansluiting: Netstroom</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"657\"><strong data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"655\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"747\">\r\n<li data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"691\">\r\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"691\">Powerplus POWC2030 cirkelzaag</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n<p data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"704\">Zaagblad</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"747\">\r\n<p data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"747\">Machine in nette, volledig geteste staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"764\"><strong data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"762\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"933\">\r\n<li data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"800\">\r\n<p data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"800\">Krachtige motor voor vlot zagen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"827\">\r\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"827\">Nauwkeurige zaagsneden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n<p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"863\">Verstelbare zaagdiepte en -hoek</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"899\">\r\n<p data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"899\">Handzaam en gebruiksvriendelijk</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"933\">\r\n<p data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"933\">Goede prijs-kwaliteitverhouding</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"953\"><strong data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"944\">Prijs</strong><br data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"947\">€49,99</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1085\"><strong data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"979\">Ophalen of verzenden</strong><br data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"982\">Afhalen bij <strong data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1023\">Used Products Spijkenisse</strong>. Verzending mogelijk; de cirkelzaag wordt zorgvuldig verpakt.</p>",
